@startuml Tessera-State-Draft
title Tessera - loading, drafting and saving states

hide empty description

state "Loading" as Loading
state "Ready" as Ready
state "Arranging (draft)" as Arranging
state "Saving" as Saving
state "Conflict" as Conflict
state "Save error" as Error

[*] --> Loading : mount

Loading --> Ready : initial provided
Loading --> Ready : adapter.load resolved (saved state)
Loading --> Ready : adapter.load rejected (saved = null, defaults)

Ready --> Arranging : start()
Ready --> Arranging : addItem / removeItem / updateItemConfig
Arranging --> Arranging : setDraft / resetDraft
Arranging --> Ready : cancel()

Ready --> Saving : reset()
Arranging --> Saving : save()

Saving --> Ready : accepted (saved = result, draft = null)
Saving --> Conflict : conflict response (draft kept)
Saving --> Error : adapter or transport threw

Conflict --> Ready : resolveConflict('theirs')
Conflict --> Saving : resolveConflict('mine')
Conflict --> Conflict : resolveConflict('mine') rejected again

Error --> Arranging : edit and retry
Error --> Ready : cancel()

note right of Arranging
  The saved state is unchanged until
  the adapter accepts a write.
end note

note right of Conflict
  conflict = other tab's LayoutState.
  The local draft is still available
  for a three-way merge.
end note

@enduml
